  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Pharaoh's Building Site",
    "overview": "The site is the Pharaoh's pyramid while it is still going up: limestone courses under a flat noon sky, red-ochre masons' marks for headlines and the one action, an electrum capstone for the ten biggest blocks. Inside the entrance the same stone is lit by torches. The mechanism is drawn: holders are blocks, rank is height, the top ten sit in the capstone, the escrow is a block hauled up the ramp, a seller is cursed out of the stone.",
